ask with message &#x27;do you love me?&#x27;
if yes, draw an ascii heart otherwise draw an ascii sad face&quot;<p>Docs and quickstart: <a href="https:&#x2F;&#x2F;web.pathwave.io&#x2F;docs" rel="nofollow">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;web.pathwave.io&#x2F;docs</a><p>Thanks
